Original work
-------------
"DrillDown" is a factory building game released in 2019 on Steam and
Google Play, developed by Dakror Games. Its source code was open-sourced
by the author in August 2024 under the Apache License 2.0.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/Dakror/DrillDown

Modifications
-------------
This repository is a derivative work (fork) based on the original
codebase and game assets. It contains substantial modifications made by
zmer4527 (2026), including but not limited to:

  * deterministic fixed-tick simulation (fixed timestep, centralized RNG)
  * LAN multiplayer (authoritative lockstep, TCP transport, state hashing)
  * build menu / UI changes

Modified files are indicated by the repository's commit history. Unless
stated otherwise, all files remain available under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE file).
